{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34261","headline":"置酒行 · 陆龟蒙","name":"置酒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落尘花片排香痕，阑珊醉露栖愁魂。\n洞庭波色惜不得，东风领入黄金尊。\n千筠掷毫春谱大，碧舞红啼相倡和。\n安知寂寞西海头，青𥳇未垂孤凤饿","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}